# AGENTS.md

How to work in this repo. It follows the app-repo standard in
[iT3E/app-template](https://github.com/iT3E/app-template), which manages
most of the repo setup (`.copier-answers.yml` lists the release); tnwks-ops
is the reference for anything not covered there.

## What this is

[% if language == 'go' %]A Go service[% else %]A Python app[% endif %][% if has_image %]. CI builds the image `[[ image_name or 'ghcr.io/it3e/<this repo>' ]]`,
which is public[% endif %]. Describe it here (what it does, where it is deployed from in
